---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout title="Privacy Policy | SarkariPhotoResizer.com" description="Privacy Policy of SarkariPhotoResizer.com. Explains our 100% on-device client-side image processing and Google AdSense compliance.">
  <div class="max-w-4xl mx-auto px-4 py-12 space-y-8">
    <div class="text-center space-y-2">
      <span class="text-xs font-black text-blue-600 uppercase tracking-wider">Legal &amp; Data Protection</span>
      <h1 class="text-3xl sm:text-4xl font-black text-slate-900 tracking-tight">Privacy Policy</h1>
      <p class="text-xs sm:text-sm text-slate-500">Last updated: November 1, 2026</p>
    </div>

    <div class="bg-white rounded-3xl p-6 sm:p-10 shadow-sm border border-slate-200/80 prose prose-slate max-w-none text-xs sm:text-sm leading-relaxed space-y-6">
      <section class="space-y-3">
        <h2 class="text-base sm:text-lg font-bold text-slate-900">1. Core Privacy Commitment: Zero Server Uploads</h2>
        <div class="p-4 bg-emerald-50 border border-emerald-200 rounded-2xl text-emerald-900 not-prose text-xs leading-relaxed">
          <strong>🔒 100% On-Device Client-Side Processing:</strong> When you select or drag an image onto SarkariPhotoResizer.com, the photograph, signature, or certificate is read directly by your web browser's local memory using HTML5 Canvas APIs. <strong>Your files are NEVER transmitted, uploaded, copied, or stored on our servers or any cloud database.</strong> Once you close or refresh your browser tab, all temporary memory is immediately released.
        </div>
      </section>

      <section class="space-y-3 border-t border-slate-100 pt-6">
        <h2 class="text-base sm:text-lg font-bold text-slate-900">2. Information We Do Not Collect</h2>
        <p class="text-slate-600">
          Because our tool operates fully on your local device:
        </p>
        <ul class="list-disc pl-5 space-y-1.5 text-slate-600">
          <li>We do not collect or store your uploaded passport photographs or digital signatures.</li>
          <li>We do not store your name, date of birth, or any text entered into the Name &amp; Date of Photo (DOP) fields.</li>
          <li>We do not require user account registration, login credentials, or passwords.</li>
        </ul>
      </section>

      <section class="space-y-3 border-t border-slate-100 pt-6">
        <h2 class="text-base sm:text-lg font-bold text-slate-900">3. Log Files &amp; Standard Analytics</h2>
        <p class="text-slate-600">
          Like most standard websites, SarkariPhotoResizer.com uses standard server log files and privacy-focused web analytics to monitor overall site performance and uptime. Information logged includes internet protocol (IP) addresses, browser type, internet service provider (ISP), referring/exit pages, date/time stamps, and basic interaction metrics. None of this information is linked to any personally identifiable information.
        </p>
      </section>

      <section class="space-y-3 border-t border-slate-100 pt-6">
        <h2 class="text-base sm:text-lg font-bold text-slate-900">4. Google AdSense &amp; Third-Party Advertising</h2>
        <p class="text-slate-600">
          SarkariPhotoResizer.com may display advertisements served by Google AdSense and authorized third-party ad networks to keep this utility 100% free for all students:
        </p>
        <ul class="list-disc pl-5 space-y-2 text-slate-600">
          <li>
            <strong>Cookies &amp; Web Beacons:</strong> Third-party vendors, including Google, use cookies to serve ads based on a user's prior visits to our website or other websites on the internet.
          </li>
          <li>
            <strong>DoubleClick DART Cookie:</strong> Google's use of advertising cookies enables it and its partners to serve ads to users based on their visits to our site and/or other sites on the Internet.
          </li>
          <li>
            <strong>Opting Out:</strong> Users may opt out of personalized advertising by visiting Google's <a href="https://adssettings.google.com/" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="text-blue-600 underline">Ads Settings</a>. Alternatively, you can opt out of third-party vendor cookies for personalized advertising by visiting <a href="https://www.aboutads.info" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="text-blue-600 underline">aboutads.info</a>.
          </li>
        </ul>
      </section>

      <section class="space-y-3 border-t border-slate-100 pt-6">
        <h2 class="text-base sm:text-lg font-bold text-slate-900">5. Children's Information</h2>
        <p class="text-slate-600">
          SarkariPhotoResizer.com does not knowingly collect any personal identifiable information from children under the age of 13. If a parent or guardian believes that our website has unintentionally recorded personal information, please contact us immediately, and we will promptly remove such records.
        </p>
      </section>

      <section class="space-y-3 border-t border-slate-100 pt-6">
        <h2 class="text-base sm:text-lg font-bold text-slate-900">6. Consent &amp; Contact</h2>
        <p class="text-slate-600">
          By using our website, you hereby consent to our Privacy Policy and agree to its terms. If you have any questions or require more information about our Privacy Policy, please feel free to reach out via our <a href="/contact" class="text-blue-600 underline font-semibold">Contact Us</a> page or email us directly at <a href="mailto:support@sarkariphotoresizer.com" class="text-blue-600 underline font-semibold">support@sarkariphotoresizer.com</a>.
        </p>
      </section>
    </div>
  </div>
</Layout>
